        "Title": "Kruger&apos;s Wrath",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110203077978",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e1a30c5-b1e0-4984-b3f4-67f01f9ebfef).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47, today&apos;s client is Helmut Kruger, the supermodel. \r\rMr Kruger has learned of tech mogul Jason Portman&apos;s plan to use surgery to mimic his appearance, and has requested that Mr Portman, his surgeon, and the hospital director be eliminated as an example to those who would dare imitate his visage. \r\rIronically, the ICA has decided to send their own Kruger lookalike to handle this task.  We don&apos;t want Kruger sending men after you, so make sure you&apos;re not spotted or recorded.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
